        "content": [
          "To begin with, for CAB, the first step is to assess the change request.",
          "check the affected systems for any impacts on the business unit",
          "determine whether the change request should be approved or not",
          "However, if the change request should not be approved in its current state, further evaluation is needed to determine if the change will be acceptable with more information provided.",
          "In this case, a request for more information is made to the Change Coordinator.",
          "The request is then followed by an email enquiry to the Change Coordinator.",
          "After that, the approval register is updated within a timeframe of 3 business days.",
          "The email enquiry is also forwarded to the Change Requester.",
          "If there are no further inquiries or issues",
          "the process concludes after 3 business days."
        ]
      },
